# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This matters: core.autocrlf is on for this machine, which would rewrite the
# shell scripts (`.githooks/pre-commit`, `scripts/*.sh`) to CRLF on checkout and
# break them under Git Bash. Shell scripts and Makefiles must stay LF.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh      text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.parquet binary
*.db      binary
